WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.985
The deadline is shared. But the work doesn't always feel shared.

00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:10.138
Meet ContriGraph. A clearer way for small software teams to plan, collaborate, and finish together.

00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:14.897
Create a project, invite your team, and choose your milestones.

00:00:15.077 --> 00:00:19.642
Give each task an owner, a deadline, an effort estimate, and the skills it needs.

00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:24.013
Open My work to see your assignments and what's due next.

00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:29.974
Update your progress, add a comment or file, and keep the team informed without another status meeting.

00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:33.919
A delayed task can hold up everything after it.

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:40.073
Connect dependencies to see what's blocked, which milestones are at risk, and where the team needs to act.

00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:46.963
Working across projects? See linked teammates' workload together, using one shared capacity.

00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:54.375
Compare remaining effort with the availability your team enters. These are planning estimates, not time tracked at a keyboard.

00:00:55.717 --> 00:01:00.069
What if only Alex can build the API? Don't hand it to someone without the skill.

00:01:00.249 --> 00:01:07.075
Keep Alex on that task. Move eligible testing work to Sam, or explore changes to scope and deadlines.

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:12.363
Use the What-if simulator to compare a change before it affects your team.

00:01:12.543 --> 00:01:20.607
Review skills, capacity, and the effect on completion dates. A lead approves the redistribution before anything is reassigned.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:28.222
Need help? Send a request from your task. Your lead gets a notification and replies in the same thread.

00:01:28.402 --> 00:01:32.839
Your inbox brings you back to the answer, so decisions stay connected to the work.

00:01:34.183 --> 00:01:37.810
When the work is ready, attach your evidence and submit it for review.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:44.582
Reviewers get notified. Feedback and acceptance are saved, so everyone can see what was delivered and checked.

00:01:45.917 --> 00:01:51.058
See project progress, unresolved blockers, and contribution evidence in one place.

00:01:51.238 --> 00:01:59.579
Recognize accepted work, reviews, and collaboration beyond task counts. Share a readable report when your team needs the full picture.

00:02:00.917 --> 00:02:04.629
Less chasing. Clearer ownership. A plan your team can explain.

00:02:04.809 --> 00:02:09.097
Start your workspace with ContriGraph. Know what's next. Plan for everyone.
